647
00:26:11.471 --> 00:26:12.771
-Ayos lang.
-Okay.

648
00:26:13.338 --> 00:26:15.205
NAG-IISIP

649
00:26:15.271 --> 00:26:17.705
LUMITAW ANG KORDERO NG SAKRIPISYO

650
00:26:17.771 --> 00:26:20.938
Sinabi ko sayong nakawin mo ang puso ko

651
