Binabayaran ko pa yung phone

684
00:27:41.905 --> 00:27:43.505
MEDYO REALISTIC ANG 2ND VERSE

685
00:27:43.571 --> 00:27:45.705
Sa kanya, ako ba

686
00:27:45.771 --> 00:27:48.071
