1082
00:41:45.738 --> 00:41:46.838
May kasabihang Kenyan.

1083
00:41:46.905 --> 00:41:49.738
Huwag humalik sa isang lalaki
na hindi nagkaroon ng karne ng buwaya.

1084
00:41:49.805 --> 00:41:52.138
Dumating ka ba sa Kenya
para may manok lang?

1085
00:41:52.205 --> 00:41:53.305
Oo, sorry.

1086
00:41:53.371 --> 00:41:55.805
- Seryoso, tao.
-Gusto kong subukan ito minsan.

1087
00:41:55.871 --> 00:41:57.605
