1167
00:44:19.205 --> 00:44:20.171
NOM

1168
00:44:20.238 --> 00:44:22.605
Pusta ko ito ay mabuti. Masarap ba at maalat?

1169
00:44:22.671 --> 00:44:25.138
-Ito ay mabuti, hindi ba?
-Mainit pa rin.

1170
00:44:25.205 --> 00:44:26.638
Ito ay perpektong tinimplahan.

1171
00:44:26.705 --> 00:44:28.438
-Kaya pala.
-Sigurado ako.

1172
00:44:28.905 --> 00:44:31.405
-Asante sana.
-Alam mo, kailangan nating kumain habang mainit.

1173
00:44:31.471 --> 00:44:33.538
So, pano natin sagutin
ang mga tanong muna?

1174
00:44:34.038 --> 00:44:34.971
dapat tayo?

1175
00:44:35.038 --> 00:44:36.971
ANG RANDOM MEAT ROUND

1176
00:44:37.038 --> 00:44:38.938
PERO PARA 2 POINTS

1177
00:44:39.005 --> 00:44:41.538
