00:47:06.805 --> 00:47:08.038
Okay, trivia question.

1254
00:47:08.705 --> 00:47:14.038
Sa US, may dating pangulo

1255
00:47:15.505 --> 00:47:17.371
na may ama at lolo na Kenyan.

1256
00:47:17.438 --> 00:47:18.338
ano?

1257
00:47:18.405 --> 00:47:20.238
Ang kanyang ama ay isang ekonomista ng Kenya,
at ang kanyang lolo--

1258
00:47:20.305 --> 00:47:21.371
alam ko.

